forms.text:
A blade that freezes foes solid;
a manifestation of the white-
knight ruler of the Tundra.

The Silverwing Great Sword's final
form. "Fear me, the galaxy-render;
hear my roar of despair."

The Silverwing Long Sword's final
form. "Fear me, the nightwaker;
terror is what shines in the dark."

The Silverwing Swiftblade's final
form. "Fear me, the starkiller;
ever fierce, in calm and ruth."

Oddly shaped Dual Blades made
from Diablos parts. Like any tyrant,
they conquer by force of will.

The Silverwing Hammer's final
form. "Fear me, the star-crusher;
in the end, naught will remain."

The Kecha Thumpa's final form:
the nexus of weaponry and art;
appreciated by all art lovers.

Like the Volvidon it came
from, once there's a target,
it goes straight to kill.

Shines with the silvery hue of the
Argent Comet. As sharp as starlight;
as powerful as a falling star.

The Silverwing Gunlance's final
form. "Fear me, the galaxy-breaker;
even cosmic armor can crack."

A Gunlance that craves ruin;
one blast frees this mighty
impulse from its chains.

The Silverwing Switch Axe's final
form. "Fear me, the star-trembler;
this edge is your demise."

The skull signifies death;
once fully charged, it
blasts foes into oblivion.

The gem signifies life;
once fully charged, it
blasts foes into the light.

A remodeled Light Bowgun made
from Bird Wyvern parts. Full-featured,
it can fire Pellet and Poison Shots.
